{"4231630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beyond Zero Line", "steam_appid": 4231630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nation is on the brink of collapse and you have been given a special order: rescue the trapped president. Run, jump, and gun your way across its interconnected districts full of enemies and secrets. Uncover the truth behind your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231630/extras/24fcf9482065b9def5eefebe311dd9c2.poster.avif?t=1765238542\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231630/extras/24fcf9482065b9def5eefebe311dd9c2.webm?t=1765238542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231630/extras/24fcf9482065b9def5eefebe311dd9c2.mp4?t=1765238542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a fast-paced metroidvania action shooter set in a gritty world torn by war. A world where every bullet matters and every step deeper brings you closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Scavenge through archives, decode notes, examine the propaganda , and piece together what is happening to the nation and why you are on a mission to save the president.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231630/extras/8b4f229ed75f8d01f56b40bdaf082da9.poster.avif?t=1765238542\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231630/extras/8b4f229ed75f8d01f56b40bdaf082da9.webm?t=1765238542\" type=\"